  (text "Disposable physical-map fixture: no circuit selection or qualification.\nTPS2553DBVR-1 | TI SLVS841F | DBV0006A six leads, no exposed pad.\n1 IN / 2 GND / 3 EN / 4 FAULT_N / 5 ILIM / 6 OUT.\nUnwired pins are intentional; no fake NC or power flags.\n12 footprint objects: 6 numbered Cu/paste/base-mask + 6 blank mask apertures.\nPackage acceptance is separate from coupled startup/short/reverse-current analysis."
